lib/IO/K8s/AutoGen.pm:285-286 -- OpenAPI/Swagger allows
additionalProperties: true as a JSON boolean (common in CRD schemas).
$addl->{q($ref)} on the blessed JSON::PP::Boolean dies with "Not a HASH
reference at AutoGen.pm line 286" -- no class or field context.

Repro (measured): spec with blob => { type => "object",
additionalProperties => JSON::PP::true } kills class generation.

Fix sketch: check ref $addl eq "HASH"; treat boolean
additionalProperties like { Str => 1 } (opaque hash). While there, the
die should name class + field (karr #42 diagnostic line).

Found in the 2026-08-18 core-module review (repro verified).
Lane: io-k8s-worker, then io-k8s-test-writer (t/04_autogen.t).
